; gp-irq-handler.b6 -- guest handler for the BENSON internal interrupt.
;
; GRP bit 18 is an INTERNAL interrupt: the CPU enters ВНУПР at 0500, DISPAK
; reads ГРП, clears what it can with РЕГ '037' and dispatches through the
; обвнп1+30 vector cell at 04023.  run-gp-irq.py sets the low 15 bits of that
; cell to 077700, so either a command fetch from 04023 or a vector read
; through ЭК 01216 reaches this word.
;
; 077700 is a free word in the booted NITI 2348 DISPAK image, above the OS
; code and clear of the switch-register area.  No 'п' line: the runner saves
; and restores the live DISPAK PC around `load`.
;
; выпр(3) returns through M[033] = IRET saved by op_int_1().  The right half
; is a harmless stop, reached only if the return is not taken.
в 77700
к выпр(3), стоп
